  <p id="c-cefu-yuangui-284-yuanfalun:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">子文獻王<persName id="c-cefu-yuangui-284-yuanfalun:p001:m0004" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">湛</persName>襲封<persName id="c-cefu-yuangui-284-yuanfalun:p001:m0007" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">湛</persName>薨子<persName id="c-cefu-yuangui-284-yuanfalun:p001:m0010" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y_A">法輪</persName>坐叔父瑾謀殺齊文襄事泄合門伏法齊王矜<persName id="c-cefu-yuangui-284-yuanfalun:p001:m0030" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">湛</persName>覆滅乃啓原之復其爵土</p>
